  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices. In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water.\n• Cut beetroot into small chunks.\n• Place beetroot on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65b6e3dac06261b8d1677b2f-72fefa50.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Grate carrot (see ingredients).\n• In a medium saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook carrot, stirring, until softened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Add the water and vegetable stock powder and bring to the boil.\n• Add couscous, stir to combine. Cover with a lid and remove from heat.\n• Set aside until the water is absorbed, 5 minutes. Fluff up with fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65b6e3dac06261b8d1677b2f-764f8e41.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the veggies have 5 minutes remaining, drain and pat haloumi dry.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook haloumi, until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. Cook haloumi in batches for the best results.\n• Return all cooked haloumi to the pan and add the honey to the pan, turning haloumi to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65b6e3dac06261b8d1677b2f-bcf77004.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the bowl with the couscous, add the roasted beetroot, baby spinach leaves and a drizzle of white wine vinegar. Toss to combine. Season to taste.\n• Divide roasted beetroot couscous between bowls. Top with haloumi, creamy pesto dressing and flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65b6e3dac06261b8d1677b2f-8dd609b2.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
